WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,840
You don’t have to stop. Everyone just wants you to die. Why don’t you dare to post it? Don’t you dare to admit it? Now you recognize Captain Lu the most.

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,000
I'll deduct half of your supplies. I swear.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:14,480
If he is a space superpower, what are you going to do if I die?

4
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,200
space superpower

5
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:19,140
I'm sick of it exploding supplies when I die.

6
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:22,020
You know the truth and you can't do this

7
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:25,940
You are killing people. Han Qingxia, you are tired of killing people just by saying two words.

8
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,090
If he wasn't a space superpower, I'd be damned

9
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,290
I'll fight you to death

10
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,290
I'm not a space superpower. Don't kill me.

11
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,450
Send them all to me

12
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,220
The oath just sworn by the front foot

13
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:38,220
Do you know that I will slap Captain Lu in the face if I'm on the back foot?

14
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,300
He is a space superpower. You liar, you hid this from me.

15
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,340
You even made me swear like that. Now that I have recognized the thing, I have taken it out.

16
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:47,100
Will you accept the cut of supplies this time?
